# The WebAssembly artifact and its generated glue. Built by scripts/build.sh, never
# committed: a checked-in binary drifts from the crates it was built from, and a stale
# one is indistinguishable from a fresh one by looking. CI builds it and the deploy
# uploads what CI built.
assets/freshet_wasm.js
assets/freshet_wasm.d.ts
assets/freshet_wasm_bg.wasm
assets/freshet_wasm_bg.wasm.d.ts
